{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-phone-screens-1-a-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"11","surface":"phone","area":"phone/screens-1","refs":["F-phone-100"],"severity":"S4","title":"The free month's 'days left' or 'ended' pop-up can open under the 'Update MettleUp' screen and then never come back","what":"When the plan is switched on, the free month pop-up and the full-screen update prompt can both be due at the same app start. Neither waits for the other, so two pop-ups open at once. The free month pop-up is marked as seen before it is shown, so if the member taps Update (the app closes for the update) it is never shown again.","expected":"One pop-up at a time; the free month pop-up waits until the update screen is closed and is marked seen only once it was really on screen.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/plan/PlanNotice.tsx:25-36","apps/mobile/src/components/UpdatePrompt.tsx:62-66","apps/mobile/src/app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx:33-38"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"plan-popup-ignores-update-popup","who":"members on the free month, once the plan switch is on","how_often":"only when a new version and a free month notice fall on the same open","fix_line":"Let the free month pop-up wait while the update screen is up, and mark it seen after it shows","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
